A. Commit message:
Revert "fix copy constructors" for older version

B. Change summary:
Reverted the changes related to copy constructors in TiffDirectory, TiffSubIfd, and TiffBinaryArray classes to prevent use after free issues due to C pointers.

C. Compatibility Risk:
High

